{
  "_comment": "Baseline kernel roles of spec 02 section 23 and spec 06a HRM-ROL-06 (slice S1.06 ruling Q2). Seeded into every customer by provisioning and the migrator's migrate command, then editable by the customer (FR-ADM-ROL-03). Permission entries are codes or patterns where * stands for any text. Scopes name a baseline data scope per resource (* = every resource of the role). Urdu names to be reviewed by a native speaker.",
